@startuml Star网络层消息序列图

title Star MMO 客户端网络层 - 完整消息收发流程

actor "游戏业务层" as Game
participant "NetworkManager\n(总入口)" as NM
participant "SocketBase\n(Socket中间层)" as SB
participant "SocketItem\n(TCP传输)" as SI
participant "DataBuffer\n(粘包处理)" as DB
participant "SocketUtils\n(协议编解码)" as SU
participant "ProtoUtils/PBSerializer\n(Pb路径)" as PB
participant "ByteStream/CustomMsg\n(自定义路径)" as CM
participant "FixMessageManager\n(消息管理)" as FMM
database "远端服务器" as Server

== 连接与验证阶段 ==

Game -> NM: Connect(ip, port)
activate NM
NM -> SB: Connect(ip, port)
activate SB
SB -> SI: ConnectAsync()
activate SI
SI -> Server: TCP Connect (后台线程)
Server --> SI: 连接成功
SI --> SB: OnConnected回调
deactivate SI

SB -> SU: FormateData(ClientVerifyReq, account)
SU -> SU: Encrypt(帧数据)
SU --> SB: 加密后的字节流
SB -> SI: SendAsync(bytes)
activate SI
SI -> Server: TCP Send
Server --> SI: ClientVerifySucceedRet
deactivate SI
SI --> SB: OnDataReceived(原始字节)
SB -> DB: AddBuffer(data, len)
DB -> DB: 拼包/检查完整帧
DB --> SB: sSocketData(完整帧)
SB -> SU: DeserializeMessageData(frame)
SU -> SU: Decrypt
SU -> SU: 识别 cmd=2 (ClientVerifySucceedRet)
SU -> CM: ByteStream反序列化
CM --> SU: ClientVerifySucceedRet对象
SU --> SB: 验证成功
deactivate SB
SB --> NM: OnLoginSuccess
NM -> Game: 回调：可以进入大厅

== RPC消息发送 (Protobuf路径) ==

Game -> NM: SendMessage(getUserInfoCmd, pbData)
NM -> SB: Send(SendMsgData)
activate SB
SB -> SocketDataPools: GetMsgData() 从池获取
SB -> SU: RPCMsgSerializer(cmd=58, pbData)
note right: RPC消息封装\n14B头+2B cmd+2B len+data
SU -> SU: FormateData(RPCMsg=58, wrapper)
SU -> SU: Encrypt
SU --> SB: 加密字节流
SB -> SI: SendAsync(bytes)
activate SI
SI -> Server: TCP Send
Server --> SI: TCP Recv
deactivate SI
SI --> SB: OnDataReceived(字节)
SB -> DB: AddBuffer
DB --> SB: sSocketData(完整帧)

SB -> SU: DeserializeMessageData(frame)
SU -> SU: Decrypt
SU -> SU: 识别 cmd=58 (RPCMsg)
SU -> PB: ProtoUtils.DeserializePbMsg(data)
PB -> PBSerializer: Deserialize<RpcWrapper>
PB -> PB: 解析内层cmd + entityId
PB --> SU: RpcMessage(cmd, entityId, pbData)
SU --> SB: 反序列化完成
SB --> NM: 入队 messageQueue
NM -> NM: Update() 取消息
NM -> ProtoDic: GetProtoInfo(RpcMessage.cmd)
ProtoDic --> NM: ProtoInfo + HandlerType
NM -> NM: 反射创建Handler，调用回调
NM -> FMM: 差量更新处理
FMM -> FMM: 分发到 ItemMD/HeroMD/PartnerMD 等
NM -> Game: 回调：数据更新完成

== 心跳机制 ==

SB -> SB: CheckHeartBeat() 定时器
SB -> SU: FormateData(HeartBeat=4)
SB -> SI: SendAsync(heartbeat)
SI -> Server: 心跳包
Server --> SI: 心跳回包

== 断线重连 ==

Server -[#red]-> SI: 连接断开
SI --> SB: OnDisconnected
SB -> SB: reconnectCount++
SB -> SB: 等待重连间隔
SB -> SI: ConnectAsync()
note right: 最多重连 3 次\n总重连不超过 5 次

@enduml
